      Key":{"$content":"a) To prevent uneven water flow and potential leaks","$type":"System.String"},"A
      Image":null,"B Answer Key":{"$content":"b) To make future repairs easier","$type":"System.String"},"B
      Image":null,"C Answer Key":{"$content":"c) To ensure the sensor works at maximum
