      Image":null,"B Answer Key":{"$content":"b) Shake the faucet to reset the sensor","$type":"System.String"},"B
      Image":null,"C Answer Key":{"$content":"c) Increase the water pressure forcefully","$type":"System.String"},"C
      Image":null,"D Answer Key":{"$content":"d) Inspect and replace the battery,
